// Live stat tables (Drew's call 2026-10-06): the NFL/CFB advanced-stat tables
// live in KV (keys nfl_epa_v1 / cfb_adv_v1), written by the weekly refresh.
// The worker pulls them fresh per request (module cache, 1h TTL per isolate)
